            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "adsarah"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Nice for summer days ..used to cook it but little bit different .. more watery with chicken stalk",
            "datePublished": "2008-08-22T02:54:06.197Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DeAnn Morelli-Murrah"
            },
            "reviewBody": "After doctoring this recipe some, this soup came out okay. First off, I like the soupy kind that you get in Mex restaurants- so I added more liquid. The noodles were alot thicker than the restaurants and I had to add more garlic than the recipe called for. (I did cloves first like it said then added garlic salt) I also added beef flavored boullion cubes because of all the extra liquid I like. After all that it was good...",
            "datePublished": "2004-07-19T21:37:39.600Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
