            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MOLSON7"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I did not care for this. Initially after all the liquid evaporated the pasta was still a little hard and tasted very bland, so to save it I added some chicken broth, parsley,pepper and adobo seasoning to liven it up. i will not make this again.",
